    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d595">

                <pb facs="0570" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg558"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A5/957</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the British Ambassador</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Lothian</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-09-18">September 18,
                        1939</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Referring to my note of September
                    11, 1939<anchor n="26" xml:id="d595-f1"/> advising you of the text of a
                    notification given on September 3, 1939 to the <pb facs="0571" n="559"
                        xml:id="pg559"/> American Ambassador at London of the suspension of the
                    London Naval Treaty of 1936, in respect of the United Kingdom of Great Britain
                    and Northern Ireland, I have now the honor to inform you that the American
                    Ambassador at London reported by cable on September 6, 1939<anchor n="27"
                        xml:id="d595-f2"/> that he had received that day an identical note from the
                    Foreign Office notifying suspension of the Treaty, in respect of the Government
                    of India, and reported by cable on September 11, 1939<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d595-f3"/> that he had received that day an identical note from the
                    Foreign Office notifying suspension of the Treaty, in respect of the Governments
                    of Australia and New Zealand.</p>
                <p>The Government of the United States has taken due note of the foregoing
                    notifications.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Walton Moore</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
